flowchart LR
    AUTHOR[Church contributor] --> SYSTEM[Sermon-to-study system]
    REVIEWER[Explicit doctrinal approver] --> SYSTEM
    PUBLISHER[Church publisher] --> SYSTEM
    MEMBER[Member or authorized public reader] --> SYSTEM
    SYSTEM --> IDENTITY[Identity provider]
    SOURCE[Manual notes and authorized source systems] --> SYSTEM
    SYSTEM --> AI[AI provider for candidate drafts]
    SYSTEM --> DELIVERY[Email and SMS providers]
    DELIVERY --> MEMBER
    OPERATOR[Platform operator with metadata access] --> SYSTEM
    BREAKGLASS[Approved scoped support access] --> SYSTEM
